+
+## Sealed owned root selector update (2026-11-03)
+
+The standing Main selector and its mount are now implemented in
+`owned-protected-backup-root.mjs` and the fixed
+`bindOwnedRuntimeHostRecoveryComposition` path. See
+[Owned protected backup root provider](OWNED_PROTECTED_BACKUP_ROOT_PROVIDER.md)
+for the durable REGISTERING/READY protocol, canonical directory identity,
+existing encrypted identity-state slot and negative validation. This supersedes
+the standing-selector limitation above. It does not supply the separate Host
